    "description": "Glo Minerals & Glo Skin Beauty\nPressed Base Powder Foundation Lot - 4 Pieces\nMixed Shades: Golden Light, Medium, Dark, and Natural Fair\nA professional-grade collection of mineral-based pressed powder foundations featuring products from both the Glo Minerals and Glo Skin Beauty eras. This high-pigment foundation is formulated to provide sheer to full coverage while nourishing the skin with a blend of antioxidants including Green Tea and Vitamins A, C, and E. Ideal for makeup artists or individuals looking for a versatile range of tones for various complexions.\nFour distinct shades included: Golden Light, Golden Medium, Golden Dark, and Natural Fair\nEach compact features a built-in mirror and includes an application sponge\nTriple-milled mineral formula designed for a natural, semi-matte finish with skin-protective benefits\nIndividual net weights range from 0.31 oz (9g) to 0.35 oz (9.9g) per compact\nCondition:\nThe items are in open-box condition. Powder surfaces appear largely intact, though minor surface handling marks or light dust from the sponges may be present. The original cardboard boxes are included but show visible shelf wear, scuffing, and small pen markings on the shade labels. All compact hinges and mirrors are intact and functional.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
